- `MaxCyclesReached` -> `KindPhaseError` (with "max cycles reached" message)
- `BudgetExceeded` -> `KindPhaseError` (with "budget exceeded" message)
- `Error` -> `KindPhaseError`
- `Info` -> `KindPhaseInfo`
